{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02707","headline":"赋得胥台露 · 庾抱","name":"赋得胥台露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胥台既落构，荆棘稍侵扉。\n栋拆连云影，梁摧照日晖。\n翔鶤逐不及，巢燕[反]无归。\n唯有团阶露，承晓共沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾抱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}